      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey my 14 month old has had bad diarrhea since yesterday and he's acting really sleepy/lethargic today. he hasn't even had a wet diaper in like 8 hours now... is it okay if i just try giving him some diluted apple juice to see if that helps him stay hydrated or should i be taking him to the er??",
