      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know, i'm just really scared and the er is so far and expensive. he's just sleeping a lot, maybe he's just tired from the sickness? could i try a Pedialyte mixed with some Gatorade or something instead of the juice? if i can just get some fluids in him now i can wait until morning to see a doctor if he's better then.",
